  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 180ca76d1d9bb80459c7a831795ce96d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  ID: ParallaxCard_17 Variant
  Config: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b594f2198c99cc34d984ff8dbd761d62, type: 2}
  Card: {fileID: 2624356407763779028, guid: f7f942a99d825a340af22f8618cc2d8a, type: 3}
  Title: The End Of The End
  Desc: "Murder, the child who may be tied to it, the endless rooms repeating like
    a prison with no escape\u2026 the numbers altered to conceal twisted sins, hidden
    behind clocks that measure time yet never move forward. Every fragment I\u2019ve
    encountered whispers of human cruelty, distorted and inverted.\n\nAt last, it
    feels as though the story has reached its end. I can only hope that this conclusion
    means freedom\u2014that I might finally leave this place and return home."
