  m_text: "\tMurder, the child who may be tied to it, the endless rooms repeating
    like a prison with no escape\u2026 the numbers altered to conceal twisted sins,
    hidden behind clocks that measure time yet never move forward. Every fragment
    I\u2019ve encountered whispers of human cruelty, distorted and inverted.\n\n\tAt
    last, it feels as though the story has reached its end. I can only hope that
    this conclusion means freedom\u2014that I might finally leave this place and
    return home.\n"
