MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1341628557}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 180ca76d1d9bb80459c7a831795ce96d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  ID: ParallaxCard_0 Variant
  Config: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b594f2198c99cc34d984ff8dbd761d62, type: 2}
  Card: {fileID: 1332383781064662900, guid: 80d4dbb5cb61f90438d14277001f2efa, type: 3}
  Title: Big Mistake
  Desc: "My name is Ethan Froze. I was on my way home, but this time I chose a road
    I had never taken before. According to the map, it cut straight through a vast
    forest\u2014ominous, yet promising to save me hours compared to the familiar
    route.\n\nBut the path was not what the map had shown. Countless forks appeared,
    none of them marked, and soon I realized I was hopelessly lost in the woods.
    I cannot tell how long I have been trapped here. Time feels distorted, and something
    unnatural lingers in the air. My car\u2019s fuel gauge has not moved at all,
    as if enchanted\u2014forever full\u2014while the body of the vehicle looks battered,
    scarred, and nearly ruined from the endless drive.\n\nBy sheer chance, I stumbled
    upon a hotel hidden deep within the forest. Hoping for directions, I stepped
    out of the car. What I did not know then was that this choice might be the gravest
    mistake of my life."
