  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 180ca76d1d9bb80459c7a831795ce96d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  ID: Hallway_12_Up_MirrorDoor
  Config: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80f4471e9297faf41a9dd0ca59eaf08a, type: 2}
  Card: {fileID: 7107028547165991705, guid: 945d304e6881dbc47a4c2d7ca0c5caea, type: 3}
  Title: Inverted Dimension
  Desc: "It\u2019s like I\u2019ve stepped into another world. A parallel dimension,
    they say\u2014everything the same, but turned inside out. On this floor, every
    door handle is on the left. Wrong. Backwards. And it makes me feel like I don\u2019t
    belong here at all.\n\r\nMaybe there\u2019s a reason I was let in. Maybe this
    place reflects the hidden side of people\u2014the twisted thoughts behind their
    smiles. Or maybe I\u2019m just losing my mind. God, please\u2026 show me the
    way back to the light."
